      "level": 0,
      "title": "Content",
      "content": [
        "# WordPress Development Guidelines v1.0\r",
        "\r",
        "**Target:** PHP 7.4+, WordPress 6.0+  \r",
        "**Editor Config:** formatOnSave: true, tabSize: 2  \r",
        "**Terminal:** cmd.exe  \r",
        "\r",
        "## Core Principles (HIGH PRIORITY)\r",
        "\r",
        "- **OOP Architecture**: Use object-oriented programming for better modularity and maintainability\r",
        "- **WordPress Standards**: Follow WordPress coding standards consistently\r",
        "- **Hooks System**: Leverage WordPress hooks (actions/filters) appropriately\r",
        "- **Security**: Implement proper security practices (nonce, sanitize, escape)\r",
        "- **Core Integrity**: Never modify core/parent theme files directly\r",
        "\r",
        "## Code Organization\r",
        "\r",
        "- Directory naming: lowercase with hyphens (wp-content/themes/my-theme)\r",
        "- File naming: descriptive, purpose-based (class-user-profile.php)\r",
        "- Enable strict typing: `declare(strict_types=1);`\r",
        "- Header format: [Description, @package, @since, @author]\r",
        "- Branch naming: feature/name, bugfix/name, hotfix/name\r",
        "\r",
        "## Data & Security (HIGH PRIORITY)\r",
        "\r",
        "- **Database**: Use `$wpdb->prepare()` for ALL queries\r",
        "- **Input**: `sanitize_*` functions before processing\r",
        "- **Output**: `esc_*` functions before display\r",
        "- **Forms**: `wp_nonce_*` functions for verification\r",
        "- **APIs**: `wp_remote_*` for external requests\r",
        "\r",
        "## WordPress Best Practices\r",
        "\r",
        "- **Theme Development**:\r",
        "  - Use child themes for customizations\r",
        "  - Follow template hierarchy\r",
        "  - Implement template tags appropriately\r",
        "  \r",
        "- **Plugin Development**:\r",
        "  - Register hooks in a main plugin class\r",
        "  - Separate functionality into logical components\r",
        "  - Follow the singleton pattern when appropriate\r",
        "  \r",
        "- **Performance**:\r",
        "  - Use transients API for caching\r",
        "  - Implement proper database indexing\r",
        "  - Optimize queries with `WP_Query`\r",
        "  \r",
        "- **Content Management**:\r",
        "  - Use custom post types for specialized content\r",
        "  - Implement custom taxonomies for relationships\r",
        "  - Leverage post meta for additional attributes\r",
        "\r",
        "## Documentation Practices\r",
        "\r",
        "- **Memory.md Updates**:\r",
        "  - Format section titles as: `## [Title] (MM-DD-2025)`\r",
        "  - Use bullet points for all major items\r",
        "  - Keep entries concise and relevant\r",
        "  - Place new entries before the \"Next Steps\" section\r",
        "  - **ALWAYS** conclude entries with the appropriate signature:\r",
        "    - For AI updates: `_Updated MM-DD-2025 | AI: Cursor (Claude 3.7 Sonnet)_`\r",
        "    - For human updates: `_Updated MM-DD-2025 | Human: tY FischEYe_`\r",
        "  - Include same date in both section title and signature line\r",
        "  - This signature system is automatically enforced through .cursorrules configuration\r",
        "  - Example format:\r",
        "    ```markdown\r",
        "    ## Feature Implementation (MM-DD-2025)\r",
        "    - Added new functionality to handle user authentication\r",
        "    - Implemented secure password reset flow\r",
        "    - Updated database schema with new user fields\r",
        "    \r",
        "    _Updated MM-DD-2025 | Human: tY FischEYe_\r",
        "    ```\r",
        "\r",
        "- **Changelog.md Updates**:\r",
        "  - Document all significant code changes\r",
        "  - Follow semantic versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)\r",
        "  - Group changes by type: Added, Changed, Fixed, Removed\r",
        "  - Include date in ISO format (2025-MM-DD)\r",
        "  - Reference ticket/issue numbers when applicable\r",
        "  - Example format:\r",
        "    ```markdown\r",
        "    ## [1.2.0] - [2025-MM-DD]\r",
        "    \r",
        "    ### Added\r",
        "    - New admin dashboard widget for quick access to settings\r",
        "    \r",
        "    ### Changed\r",
        "    - Improved login form validation with better error messages\r",
        "    \r",
        "    ### Fixed\r",
        "    - Fixed issue with password reset emails not being sent correctly (#45)\r",
        "    ```\r",
        "\r",
        "## Key Coding Conventions\r",
        "\r",
        "1. **Database Interactions**:\r",
        "   ```php\r",
        "   global $wpdb;\r",
        "   $results = $wpdb->get_results(\r",
        "       $wpdb->prepare(\"SELECT * FROM {$wpdb->posts} WHERE post_author = %d\", $user_id)\r",
        "   );\r",
        "   ```\r",
        "\r",
        "2. **Hooks Implementation**:\r",
        "   ```php\r",
        "   // Adding hooks\r",
        "   add_action('init', [$this, 'register_post_types'], 10);\r",
        "   add_filter('the_content', [$this, 'filter_content']);\r",
        "   \r",
        "   // Creating hook\r",
        "   do_action('my_plugin_action', $context);\r",
        "   $value = apply_filters('my_plugin_filter', $value, $context);\r",
        "   ```\r",
        "\r",
        "3. **Security Implementation**:\r",
        "   ```php\r",
        "   // Nonce\r",
        "   wp_nonce_field('my_action', 'my_nonce');\r",
        "   if (!wp_verify_nonce($_POST['my_nonce'], 'my_action')) {\r",
        "       wp_die('Security check failed');\r",
        "   }\r",
        "   \r",
        "   // Sanitizing input\r",
        "   $title = sanitize_text_field($_POST['title']);\r",
        "   \r",
        "   // Escaping output\r",
        "   echo esc_html($title);\r",
        "   ```\r",
        "\r",
        "## Workflow Requirements\r",
        "\r",
        "- **Git**: Commit each atomic change with clear message\r",
        "- **Branches**: NEVER commit to main, always feature branches\r",
        "- **Testing**: Verify all changes before requesting review\r",
        "- **Documentation**: Update memory.md, changelog.md with each change\r",
        "\r",
        "## Communications Preferences\r",
        "\r",
        "- Prefer terse answers with functional code examples\r",
        "- Explain reasoning clearly for beginners\r",
        "- Present solutions with confidence level (1-10)\r",
        "- Ask 3-5 clarifying questions when needed\r",
        "\r",
        "---\r",
        "\r",
        "## Architecture Patterns\r",
        "\r",
        "### Class Structure Example\r",
        "\r",
        "```php\r",
        "<?php\r",
        "/**\r",
        " * User profile handler.\r",
        " *\r",
        " * @package     MyPlugin\r",
        " * @since       1.0.0\r",
        " * @author      Developer Name\r",
        " */\r",
        "\r",
        "declare(strict_types=1);\r",
        "\r",
        "namespace MyPlugin\\User;\r",
        "\r",
        "use MyPlugin\\Core\\BaseController;\r",
        "\r",
        "class User_Profile extends BaseController {\r",
        "    /**\r",
        "     * User ID.\r",
        "     *\r",
        "     * @var int\r",
        "     */\r",
        "    private int $user_id;\r",
        "    \r",
        "    /**\r",
        "     * Constructor.\r",
        "     *\r",
        "     * @param int $user_id User ID.\r",
        "     */\r",
        "    public function __construct(int $user_id) {\r",
        "        $this->user_id = $user_id;\r",
        "        $this->register_hooks();\r",
        "    }\r",
        "    \r",
        "    /**\r",
        "     * Register hooks.\r",
        "     *\r",
        "     * @return void\r",
        "     */\r",
        "    private function register_hooks(): void {\r",
        "        add_action('show_user_profile', [$this, 'add_profile_fields']);\r",
        "        add_action('edit_user_profile', [$this, 'add_profile_fields']);\r",
        "        add_action('personal_options_update', [$this, 'save_profile_fields']);\r",
        "        add_action('edit_user_profile_update', [$this, 'save_profile_fields']);\r",
        "    }\r",
        "    \r",
        "    /**\r",
        "     * Add custom profile fields.\r",
        "     *\r",
        "     * @param \\WP_User $user User object.\r",
        "     * @return void\r",
        "     */\r",
        "    public function add_profile_fields(\\WP_User $user): void {\r",
        "        // Security check\r",
        "        wp_nonce_field('my_plugin_user_profile', 'my_plugin_user_profile_nonce');\r",
        "        \r",
        "        // Output fields\r",
        "        ?>\r",
        "        <h3><?php esc_html_e('Additional Information', 'my-plugin'); ?></h3>\r",
        "        <table class=\"form-table\">\r",
        "            <tr>\r",
        "                <th>\r",
        "                    <label for=\"bio\"><?php esc_html_e('Biography', 'my-plugin'); ?></label>\r",
        "                </th>\r",
        "                <td>\r",
        "                    <textarea name=\"bio\" id=\"bio\" rows=\"5\" cols=\"30\"><?php echo esc_textarea(get_user_meta($user->ID, 'bio', true)); ?></textarea>\r",
        "                </td>\r",
        "            </tr>\r",
        "        </table>\r",
        "        <?php\r",
        "    }\r",
        "    \r",
        "    /**\r",
        "     * Save custom profile fields.\r",
        "     *\r",
        "     * @param int $user_id User ID.\r",
        "     * @return bool\r",
        "     */\r",
        "    public function save_profile_fields(int $user_id): bool {\r",
        "        // Security checks\r",
        "        if (!current_user_can('edit_user', $user_id)) {\r",
        "            return false;\r",
        "        }\r",
        "        \r",
        "        if (!isset($_POST['my_plugin_user_profile_nonce']) || !wp_verify_nonce($_POST['my_plugin_user_profile_nonce'], 'my_plugin_user_profile')) {\r",
        "            return false;\r",
        "        }\r",
        "        \r",
        "        // Sanitize and save data\r",
        "        if (isset($_POST['bio'])) {\r",
        "            update_user_meta($user_id, 'bio', sanitize_textarea_field($_POST['bio']));\r",
        "        }\r",
        "        \r",
        "        return true;\r",
        "    }\r",
        "} ",
        "",
        "_Updated MM-DD-2025 | Human: tY FischEYe_"
      ]
    }
  ],
